WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
(funky music)

00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:09.194
- I think the only real
way to push a eco-conscious

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:13.595
agenda is to just make the
things that are eco-conscious

00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:15.178
a little more sexy.

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:22.083
Ready Freddie?

00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:26.269
(grinder whirring)

00:00:26.269 --> 00:00:29.936
My name is Josh Hadar,
I'm a metal sculptor.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:34.957
My artistic platform is
sculptures, bikes, that all

00:00:36.573 --> 00:00:40.051
have the same theme of
eco-consciousness and sustainability.

00:00:40.051 --> 00:00:41.455
Aahh!

00:00:41.455 --> 00:00:42.870
Whoo, solar energy.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.338
There are lots of
electric bikes out there,

00:00:45.338 --> 00:00:46.997
but, you know, I don't think you're
going to get a whole lot of

00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:51.181
interest without that bike
being a real head-turner.

00:00:51.181 --> 00:00:52.206
(welder snapping)

00:00:52.206 --> 00:00:54.564
I learned how to weld at
the university of YouTube.

00:00:54.564 --> 00:00:56.245
(laughing)

00:00:56.245 --> 00:00:59.157
I didn't really have
anything in mind to build

00:00:59.157 --> 00:01:00.060
when I started to weld.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.484
I just loved the process.

00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:03.946
(welding buzzing)

00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:05.732
This bike not only runs on solar energy,

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:09.069
but it was completely
created by solar energy.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:12.302
The same system that I use
to power the batteries,

00:01:12.302 --> 00:01:15.134
I use to power all my
hand tools, and basically,

00:01:15.134 --> 00:01:19.694
all of these are made
strictly by hand tools.

00:01:19.694 --> 00:01:22.211
And then, basically, once you buy it,

00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:23.551
there's virtually no costs.

00:01:23.551 --> 00:01:25.790
You know, you don't have to
gas it up, you don't whatever,

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:29.003
solar, it's from the
sky, it's from the sun.

00:01:29.003 --> 00:01:31.463
Once I had my kids, my
priorities really changed

00:01:31.463 --> 00:01:35.130
and that was just, you know, bI
want a cleaner planet.

